From 1818181818181818181818181818181818181818 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sysretq0 <324514544+sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 05:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/18] memory: mediatek: Add MediaTek MT6789 SMI support

Add support for the MediaTek MT6789 (Helio G99) Smart Multimedia
Interface (SMI) Local Arbiter (LARB) and Common blocks.

On MT6789, SMI Common handles GALS asynchronous clock domain crossing
and balances LARB channels entering MMU0/MMU1 via bus_sel:
F_MMU1_LARB(1) | F_MMU1_LARB(2) | F_MMU1_LARB(4) | F_MMU1_LARB(5) |
F_MMU1_LARB(7).

Provide the per-port outstanding request depth (ostd) table for MT6789
local arbiters (notably LARB0 serving OVL0 and LARB1 serving OVL0_2L
and RDMA0) and add devicetree bindings.

Signed-off-by: sysretq0 <324514544+sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
